# Adventuring Gear: "Landfall -- Whenever a land you control enters, equipped creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn." Each land
# that enters triggers it once and the bonuses add up (CR 603.2, 613.4c). On turn 1 Bot1 equips Memnite (Mox Ruby casts the
# Gear, Mox Jet pays the equip), plays Evolving Wilds (+2/+2: 3/3) and sacrifices it for a Forest, which enters tapped and
# triggers it again (5/5). Both bonuses end with the turn: on Bot2's turn 2 the Memnite is 1/1.

